An automated AI system that reads customer emails, classifies them, generates replies, and sends responses — all without human involvement.
Designed to save businesses hours of manual support work.

📌 What This Agent Does

📥 Watches incoming emails

🧠 Classifies messages (support, refund, product query, etc.)

🤖 Routes each email to the correct specialized AI agent

📚 Uses RAG + vector store to access company policies & knowledge

✍️ Generates accurate, contextual replies

📊 Logs outputs to Google Sheets

✉️ Sends responses back through Gmail

🧭 How It Works (Pipeline)

Email watcher detects new messages

Emails are batched for processing

Classifier predicts category

Specialized agent handles the email

Agent retrieves business knowledge (RAG pipeline)

Reply is generated and saved

Google Sheets logs everything

Gmail sends the final answer to the customer

🔧 Tech Used

LLM-based classifier

Custom AI agents (support / refund / product queries)

RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)

Vector store for company knowledge

Google Sheets API

Gmail API

n8n / Make / automation workflows

